#: woo-product-sync-manager.php:69
msgid "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce is missing its dependencies. Run \"composer install\" in the plugin directory."
msgstr "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce fehlen seine Abhängigkeiten. Führe \"composer install\" im Plugin-Verzeichnis aus."

#. translators: %s: minimum supported WooCommerce version.
#: woo-product-sync-manager.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce requires WooCommerce %s or newer to be installed and active."
msgstr "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce benötigt WooCommerce %s oder neuer, installiert und aktiviert."

#: woo-product-sync-manager.php:102
msgid "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce requires High-Performance Order Storage. Marketplace orders are not shown until it is enabled."
msgstr "Product Sync Manager for WooCommerce benötigt die High-Performance Order Storage. Marktplatz-Bestellungen werden erst angezeigt, wenn sie aktiviert ist."

#: woo-product-sync-manager.php:107
msgid "Enable High-Performance Order Storage"
msgstr "High-Performance Order Storage aktivieren"
